{"title":"Embalmed Priest","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 49 Mummy that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (4.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: reviveHpFraction: .4</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/embalming-resin\">Embalming Resin</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>183</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>149</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>21</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>183</td><td>in the wilds around 2074, 900</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>149</td><td>in the wilds around 2079, 898</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 6 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 6 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 354 total, 11–101 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"burial-wrappings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 67% of 6 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 4/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"funerary-amulet\" title=\"Funerary Amulet - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ec66ba5cfceb6dc5cfbe.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Funerary Amulet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"burial-wrappings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 67% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 7 total, 7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 4/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"embalming-resin\" title=\"Embalming Resin - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c14fa819b67a6c555eef.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embalming Resin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"shagbark-staff\" title=\"Shagbark Staff (staff-ice x1) - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Staff</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sun King&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 94</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-195\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1038.6px,-1219.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:1019.0px;top:1227.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1023.8px;top:1219.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1045.4px;top:1221.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1021.1px;top:1217.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1118.5px;top:1276.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1092.1px;top:1212.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1032.6px;top:1218.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1104.3px;top:1274.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1079.2px;top:1206.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1028.4px;top:1295.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1045.4px;top:1219.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1037.3px;top:1210.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:994.7px;top:1231.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1153.0px;top:1256.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1059.6px;top:1203.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1155.0px;top:1253.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1069.8px;top:1278.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1059.6px;top:1219.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1071.1px;top:1203.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1078.6px;top:1226.3px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2078, 898 <span class=\"muted\">· 21 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2206, 919 <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2183, 1018 <span class=\"muted\">· 1